OPENAI_API_KEY= Use You own key from OpenAI
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

MAX_INPUT_CHARS=5000
MAX_OUTPUT_CHARS=6000

#Alternative of Guardrails AI
==============================
#Guardrails AI :Guardrails AI is an open-source Python framework that 
#validates LLM inputs and outputs to improve reliability, safety, and compliance.

# NVIDIA NeMo Guardrails : Open-source framework for input/output safety, jailbreak detection, 
# topic control, and conversation-flow rules. 

# LLM Guard :Open-source toolkit with scanners for prompt injection, sensitive data, toxicity, 
# and other LLM risks.

# Pydantic AI: Provides an agent framework; its guardrail capabilities can validate and 
# block input/output. 

# LangChain: LLM application framework that lets you build custom input/output 
# checks and integrate security tools.

# Amazon Bedrock Guardrails:	Managed AWS service for applying safety, privacy, and 
# content-filtering policies to model interactions.

# Azure AI Content Safety	Azure service for detecting harmful content and supporting 
# prompt-shield protections.



















